            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Steady Balance"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Whenever the harbormaster rolls a success on a check to Balance, they get a critical success instead. They're not flat-footed while Balancing on narrow surfaces and uneven ground. They can attempt an Acrobatics check instead of a Reflex save to Grab an Edge."
